      "@type": "ToxicityAssessment",
      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Mysogynous",
      "description": "The meme uses the misogynous stereotype that women 'belong in the kitchen' by juxtaposing the image of three professionally dressed women at a sponsored event with the text 'slow cooker'. This reduces their professional presence to a domestic function, reinforcing outdated gender norms and diminishing their achievements.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
